# Hyprland global shortcuts the Omarchy shell registers, one per line: a menu
# route to toggle, a panel plugin to toggle, a volume key, or an argument-free
# IPC call as target.method. A binding written as o.bind(keys, description,
# { menu = "theme" }), { panel = "omarchy.emojis" }, { audio = "raise" } or
# { ipc = "media.next" } dispatches the matching shortcut straight to the shell,
# with no process to spawn per keypress. Anything missing here still binds,
# through the omarchy-menu, omarchy-shell or omarchy-audio-output-volume
# command instead.
menu root
menu apps
menu capture
menu toggle
menu hardware
menu system
menu background
menu theme
menu share
menu reminder-set
panel omarchy.clipboard
panel omarchy.emojis
panel omarchy.audio
panel omarchy.bluetooth
panel omarchy.monitor
panel omarchy.clock
panel omarchy.network
panel omarchy.power
audio raise
audio lower
audio mute-toggle
ipc media.playPause
ipc media.next
ipc media.previous
ipc notifications.dismissOne
ipc notifications.dismissAll
ipc notifications.invokeLast
ipc notifications.showHistory
